00:47:56.220 --> 00:47:57.840
how can I help you more?

00:47:57.840 --> 00:47:58.680
Helpful tone.

00:47:58.680 --> 00:47:59.670
Here it is.

00:47:59.670 --> 00:48:01.890
So by changing the instructions,

00:48:01.890 --> 00:48:04.710
I was able to improve the
response format and the kind

00:48:04.710 --> 00:48:07.320
of quality of response
that I wanted.

00:48:07.320 --> 00:48:08.250
Excellent.

00:48:08.250 --> 00:48:09.720
Took me just a second.

00:48:09.720 --> 00:48:10.950
So what can we do next?

00:48:10.950 --> 00:48:12.960
We've improved the model.

00:48:12.960 --> 00:48:14.790
We've improved the response.

00:48:14.790 --> 00:48:18.120
And you can also notice
over here that I can see

00:48:18.120 --> 00:48:21.570
