00:49:39.360 --> 00:49:40.050
So excellent.

00:49:40.050 --> 00:49:40.920
Let's keep going.

00:49:40.920 --> 00:49:42.780
We've improved our model.

00:49:42.780 --> 00:49:43.950
We've improved the instruction,

