00:51:20.310 --> 00:51:22.890
And now it gives me
a file search tool

00:51:22.890 --> 00:51:26.160
that I can associate
with this agent.

00:51:26.160 --> 00:51:27.510
But I want to actually,
let's go ahead

00:51:27.510 --> 00:51:29.760
and add all the
different products

00:51:29.760 --> 00:51:31.200
that we have in for Zava.

00:51:31.200 --> 00:51:33.150
So that way we can
kind of figure

00:51:33.150 --> 00:51:35.790
out if the paint is among them.

00:51:35.790 --> 00:51:37.590
So we're going to
browse for files.

00:51:37.590 --> 00:51:39.300
And the first time I
just put these 10,

00:51:39.300 --> 00:51:41.760
so let's go ahead
and get the rest in.

00:51:41.760 --> 00:51:44.290
So we're going to
