01:15:09.360 --> 01:15:13.590
The big takeaway is when
you're building agents

01:15:13.590 --> 01:15:17.310
for enterprise scale, agents
are like microservices

01:15:17.310 --> 01:15:19.590
that combine together
to orchestrate

01:15:19.590 --> 01:15:21.840
